Summary
Adds an opt-in specialized decode path (--monokernel) for MiniMax-M3-MXFP4 on gfx950. During decode, layers 3–59 run their FFN half as one persistent FlyDSL launch:

TP all-reduce, residual add and post-attention RMSNorm;
the FP32 router with top-4 selection;
the shared and routed BF16×MXFP4

Overview
This PR adds an NVIDIA specialized decode for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash on GB300, for the small decode batches that agentic serving runs. It supports:

one GB300 tray at TP4;
DSpark speculative decoding with 5 draft tokens;
FULL-graph decode steps of up to 384 rows (64 requests × 6 tokens). Prefi
